Usage: fno config history [OPTIONS] [KEY]

  Read config-write receipts from the global and project journals.

Arguments:
  [KEY]  Exact config key or dotted prefix to filter.

Options:
  --limit INTEGER RANGE         Maximum rows to print.  [default: 50; x>=1]
  -J, --json                    Emit matching rows as JSONL.
  --scope [global|project|all]  Limit rows by the config scope that was written.
                                [default: all]
  --help                        Show this message and exit.
